==Corruptions==
[[File:Corruption_example.png|frameless|left|128x128px]]
Corruptions looks like a swirling circular distortion that occasionally spawns on the screen. They will spawn every 144 minutes (2.4 hours), stacking up to a maximum of 10, and can accumulate offline (up to 24h).
{{Clear}}
